cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the original dataset when using this work."
type: software
title: "neurocalib-bench: Budget-controlled cross-day neural decoding"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
authors:
  - family-names: Rahim
    given-names: Nigmat
    alias: Nigmat-future
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nigmat-future/neurocalib-bench"
url: "https://github.com/Nigmat-future/neurocalib-bench"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible offline benchmark comparing neural-decoder adaptation under
  fixed new-day calibration time budgets. It preserves an original pilot and
  a supervised calibration study with repeated development selection, failed
  hypotheses, and a two-animal final comparison. Final-test evaluation is
  separated from development by a content-hashed local freeze.
